WEBVTT

00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:31.476
working at a lab at MIT
with a small group of researchers,

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.893
and through studying our language

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:36.309
and the way that we communicate
with other people,

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:40.101
he has stumbled upon
the secret of human intimacy.

00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:43.018
Here to give us his perspective,
please welcome to the stage,

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:44.351
Anthony Veneziale.

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:47.083
(Applause)

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:57.042
(Laughter)

00:00:58.917 --> 00:01:02.643
Anthony Veneziale: You might think
I know what you're going through.